---
import { contextModules } from "../../data/npc";
import WorkflowDiagram from "../WorkflowDiagram.astro";
import EvidenceFigure from "../EvidenceFigure.astro";
---

<section class="visual-section">
  <p class="eyebrow">架构重绘 · 以原始 Thesis 图为依据</p>
  <h2>让 Context 成为明确的系统结构</h2>
  <div class="npc-architecture">
    <div class="npc-main">
      <div class="flow-node">Player</div>
      <div class="flow-node">Player Interaction Layer</div>
      <div class="flow-node">NPC Agent</div>
      <section class="context-box" id="persistent-context">
        <h3>Persistent Context Management</h3>
        <div class="context-grid">
          {contextModules.map((m) => (
            <div>
              <strong>{m.name}</strong>
              <p>{m.text}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>
      <div class="flow-node">Dialogue / Action Reasoning</div>
      <div class="flow-node" id="npc-output">
        NPC Dialogue / Action
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="logging-note">
      <span class="eyebrow">次要观测路径</span>
      <h3>Evaluation Logging</h3>
      <p>
        <span class="dashed-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
          ⇢
        </span>{" "}
        Persistent Context
      </p>
      <p>
        <span class="dashed-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
          ⇢
        </span>{" "}
        Dialogue / Action
      </p>
      <small>原图中的两条虚线均流向 Logging，不参与主要推理链路。</small>
    </aside>
  </div>
  <div class="insight-grid">
    <article>
      <h3>Rule-based</h3>
      <p>确定性的状态与边界尽量交给可控逻辑。</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h3>LLM</h3>
      <p>承担需要自然语言理解、推理与生成的部分。</p>
    </article>
  </div>
  <p class="source-note">
    这是 Hybrid 分工原则，不表示每个 Context Module 都完全由规则或完全由 LLM
    实现。
  </p>
</section>
<WorkflowDiagram
  title="持续运行的反馈循环"
  steps={[
    "Interaction",
    "Context Update",
    "Reasoning",
    "Dialogue / Action",
    "New Experience / World Change",
    "Context Update",
  ]}
/>
<p class="source-note">
  运行循环示意：根据项目说明整理，与上方原始实现架构分开展示。
</p>
<details class="disclosure">
  <summary>对照原始 Architecture Diagram</summary>
  <EvidenceFigure asset="npc-original" />
</details>
